      },
      {
        "text": "Mass street violence shut down the counting of electoral college votes.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "This interrupted the peaceful transfer of power through the counting of electoral college votes for the first time in American history.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker and many colleagues had categorized events outside the building separately from those inside the building.",
